  m_text: "<color=#EF5350><b>\u2022 DISARMAMENT EXEMPTION:</b></color> <color=#CFD8DC>Declared defensive sidearms licensed under Martial Edict 2026-09.</color>\n<color=#EF5350><b>\u2022 EVACUATION CORRIDOR:</b></color> <color=#CFD8DC>Proceed along I-80 North checkpoints. Mandatory curfew 19:00 - 06:00.</color>\n<color=#EF5350><b>\u2022 CONCEALMENT PENALTY:</b></color> <color=#CFD8DC>Concealing bite wounds is high treason punishable by internment.</color>\n<color=#78909C>FIELD EXAMINER: [Agent M. Vance // #8841-B]</color>    <color=#66BB6A><b>STAMP: VERIFIED</b></color>"
